      "content": "The primary risk to be aware of is the potential loss of nuanced contextual understanding that my generative model provides, which the deterministic tool might overlook. While traceability is valued, the deterministic approach may miss subtle, qualitative patterns that are crucial for high-level peer review. Furthermore, I recommend a shadow-testing period to directly compare the output quality of both systems before fully decommissioning my module.",
